# REQUIRES: python-api, hdf5, cuda
# Drawn velocities and typed restraints in the Python model on a GPU
# (D198), scenario mixed-nvt of Inputs/python_velocities_restraints.py.
# NVT runs with drawn velocities and restraints against `mdir run` of the
# same control file in mixed precision.
# The bound takes the NVT run of `mdir run` in double precision, a
# reference only (scenario nvt-double compares the model with it).
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_velocities_restraints.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide GPU mdir mdir-model-test %t mixed-nvt | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: NVT Mixed; positions
# CHECK: velocities and restraints mixed-nvt passed
